WEBVTT

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:05.640
I, Aihara Kotoko...

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:09.490
...have finally become Irie-kun’s bride!

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:14.190
Blessed by everyone, it was a wedding ceremony filled with lots and lots of joy.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.380
No! Who the hell would ride that?!

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:21.370
Why not? Hurry.

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:24.870
There, there. It’s time.

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:27.400
Argh, wait!

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:30.900
Ladies and gentlemen, please give a rousing welcome.

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:35.140
Making their way in: the bride and the groom!

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:38.420
Kotoko-chan! Onii-chan!
You look wonderful!

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:41.780
When I get married,
it’ll be just the two of us.

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:43.160
That might be a good idea.

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:52.320
Kotoko!

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:55.040
Satomi! Jinko!

00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:58.540
What’s with this gigantic cake?!

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:02.970
Yes, it was requested that the cake be made taller than any cake before.

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.610
Now then, everyone...

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:15.140
After birth, the bridegroom Naoki-san, surrounded by his parents’ abundant love...

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:16.390
Don’t tell me...!

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:18.140
Stop!

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:20.940
...grew up this adorably!

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:26.520
Mom!

00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:29.900
Onii-chan! No way!

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:32.310
I’m finally able to tell everyone.

00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:34.910
That’s a load off my shoulders.

00:01:39.370 --> 00:01:41.670
I had fun, but...

00:01:41.670 --> 00:01:45.690
...it seemed like Irie-kun was just a suffering bystander.

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:54.010
Well, after all that, we’re now headed to Hawaii for our honeymoon!

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:34.630
What is it?

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:38.080
I was just thinking that we’re
really married now.

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:40.950
I’m only now starting to realize
the reality of this.

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:43.270
Everything was like a dream during the wedding ceremony.

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:45.120
I don’t really want to remember.

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:47.150
I’m going to sleep.

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:49.700
What? No!

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:51.340
Don’t talk to me.

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:52.810
How boring.

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:55.840
And it’s our first trip together alone too.

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:58.520
Excuse me, but you two are on the same tour, aren’t you?

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:01.880
We’re going on our honeymoon too.

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:03.970
I’m Horiuchi Mari.

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:05.850
This is my husband, Takumi-kun.

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:07.040
Nice to meet you.

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:08.310
Hi, nice to meet you.

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:10.400
Nice to meet you. I’m Ai-...

00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:13.360
...Irie Kotoko.

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:15.570
This is my husband...

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:18.300
Husband, eh?

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:20.700
...Naoki-kun.

00:04:20.970 --> 00:04:22.890
What a handsome husband.

00:04:22.890 --> 00:04:24.820
That’s right!

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:27.050
Ah, Takumi-kun. I’d like some wine.

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:30.210
And grab a magazine after that too.

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:35.810
Your husband sure is kind.

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:39.010
Really? That’s pretty normal.

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:41.950
That’s normal?

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:47.930
Well, it’s kinda one-sided as Takumi-kun is crazy over me.

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:50.160
It’s a boring romance from work.

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:51.630
How about you?

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:55.330
For us, I was the only one pushing and pushing.

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:58.060
I guess it’s sort of like winning after five years of persistence.

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:01.250
You pushed and pushed and finally pushed him down, eh?

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:02.220
Well done!

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:05.250
You’ve got the wrong idea!
We’ve had a wholesome relationship!

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:08.370
You’re kidding! You two haven’t done...?

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:13.300
That’s incredible. But aren’t you worried though?

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:14.450
Worried?

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:16.520
That your husband doesn’t want you.

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:18.590
As a woman, doesn’t that worry you?

00:05:19.530 --> 00:05:21.280
I would be in shock.

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:24.210
I would worry about not having any sex appeal.

00:05:25.270 --> 00:05:28.230
Well, I hope you guys don’t get a Narita divorce.

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:31.000
Irie-kun!

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:34.560
Narita divorce?!

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:45.160
Just what was that?!

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:49.450
That Mari woman, saying whatever she wants!

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:52.690
And on of that, that Narita divorce thing wasn’t an act.

00:05:58.260 --> 00:06:00.550
Irie-kun!

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:12.990
Show him your passport already!

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:15.370
Irie-kun!

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:18.030
Sheesh! That’s middle school level English.

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:26.440
Thank you.

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:27.950
Thanks.

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:30.950
This isn’t your first time in Hawaii?

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:35.160
My father’s company has a house here, so I’ve been here about three times before.

00:06:36.470 --> 00:06:38.710
This is the first time I’ve been
on a trip overseas.

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:40.150
Kotoko-san!

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:41.080
Mari-san.

00:06:42.760 --> 00:06:45.680
Your husband is really handsome from up close!

00:06:46.660 --> 00:06:49.480
Irie-kun, she’s from the same tour.
Her name is...

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:51.860
...Horiuchi Mari. Nice to meet you.

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:52.690
Hello.

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:56.740
Hey, you call your husband Irie-kun?

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:59.380
It’s a habit of many years.

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:01.730
How weird. So distant.

00:07:02.140 --> 00:07:03.310
Right, Naoki-san?

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:06.660
Why is she being so overly familiar?!

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:09.260
Anyway, where’s your husband?

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:11.160
Eh? He was with me.

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:20.770
What is he doing?

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:23.410
I think your husband is having some trouble.

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:38.940
Naoki-san is incredible!

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:42.640
He is, isn’t he?

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:44.280
Don’t call him Naoki-san!

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:47.670
You saved me there.

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:49.880
They prey on tourists.

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:52.630
If you’re not careful, they’ll charge exorbitant fares.

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:56.250
Man, Takumi-kun is so lame.

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:57.400
I’m so disappointed.

00:07:57.400 --> 00:07:58.550
Sorry.

00:07:58.550 --> 00:08:02.570
Thank goodness! I can now rest easy if we’re with your husband.

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:05.150
Best regards during our stay.

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:10.720
It must be great, Kotoko-san, having such a wonderful husband...

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:13.010
Hey, why don’t you trade with me?

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:16.690
I’m kidding! Come, let’s go.

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:21.170
I have a bad premonition about this...

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:27.860
It’s Hawaii!

00:08:28.720 --> 00:08:30.620
What a wonderful room.

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:36.390
A bed fit for a princess!

00:08:37.590 --> 00:08:40.620
Will you calm down a little? Sheesh.

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:42.000
Irie-kun.

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:45.770
I may be a desperate person, but...

00:08:45.770 --> 00:08:47.540
...I’m in your hands.

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:50.830
I think you’re trying to say inexperienced, right?

00:08:51.970 --> 00:08:57.010
But I guess desperate isn’t necessarily incorrect in your case.

00:08:57.370 --> 00:09:01.160
I’ll do my best to become a good wife to you.

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:03.600
So, please don’t abandon me.

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:10.070
I’m not expecting anything, so just remain the way you are.

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:14.280
Irie-kun.

00:09:15.340 --> 00:09:17.710
What a nice mood!

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:20.650
Hello?

00:09:20.650 --> 00:09:23.250
Hello, Naoki-san! It’s Mari.

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:25.630
Say, would you like to go swimming now?

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:28.000
We’ll be waiting at the beach below.

00:09:29.350 --> 00:09:31.130
Well, you heard her. Want to go?

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:33.000
Damn her!

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:35.300
Just when we had a mood going!

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:40.120
Over here.

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:47.740
Shall we get going?

00:09:47.740 --> 00:09:51.740
Hey, that’s my husband. Umm...

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:55.250
What the heck is that?

00:09:55.910 --> 00:09:58.990
They look good together!

00:10:08.990 --> 00:10:10.220
Kotoko...

00:10:10.220 --> 00:10:12.780
Kotoko is in Hawaii now!

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:17.410
Kinnosuke, adultery is not right.

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:20.010
What are you saying? My love is strong!

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:22.750
Kotoko is already married.

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:24.270
I know!

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:26.680
Besides, why are you here?!

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:29.020
Everyday too! Haven’t you had enough?!

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:32.970
Be a man and give up. Then you can lead a happy life with me.

00:10:32.970 --> 00:10:35.180
Stop with that English-Kansai dialect!

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:41.520
Kotoko is alone with that
insufferable know-it-all.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:46.260
Not only can we not be alone...

00:10:46.260 --> 00:10:49.210
...but just what’s wrong with this woman!

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:53.260
Hey, shouldn’t you be doing something about this since you’re the husband?

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:55.960
I’m sorry. I understand.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:57.310
But, I just can’t firmly tell her.

00:10:57.310 --> 00:10:59.760
How can you be so weak willed?!

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:05.120
Rather, I’m afraid that Naoki-san would fall for Mari.

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:07.420
What are you saying?

00:11:07.420 --> 00:11:11.490
Irie-kun has absolutely no interest in those kinds of girls.

00:11:11.490 --> 00:11:13.850
What do you mean by “those kinds”?!

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:17.260
It’s true that she’s very demanding!

00:11:17.260 --> 00:11:19.040
However, I know her!

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:23.120
I know her adorableness and her sweetness! She’s my life!

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:25.390
Well, they look like they’re having fun.

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:26.950
Let’s go swim together.

00:11:28.490 --> 00:11:29.890
What was that?!

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:31.790
Oh, mistake!

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:34.210
I’m sorry!

00:11:37.100 --> 00:11:39.400
Hey, want to go to the beach on the other side?

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:40.660
Why don’t you go with your husband?

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:43.220
No, I want to go with you!

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:47.920
Hey, what’s wrong with you?!

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:50.560
Mistake, sorry!

00:11:51.110 --> 00:11:52.780
Nice, Madam!

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:55.390
Do your best, Kotoko-chan.

00:11:55.390 --> 00:11:56.790
Thank you.

00:11:56.790 --> 00:11:59.180
Eh? How does she know my name?

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:02.790
After that, my premonition was right on.

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:07.220
Mari-san kept on interfering with our relationship.

00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:08.090
It’s beautiful, isn’t it?

00:12:08.090 --> 00:12:08.710
Thanks.

00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:12.180
And what’s worse, it happens every day and every night...

00:12:12.180 --> 00:12:13.650
Wonderful.

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:17.000
Eh? So, you’re studying to become a doctor, Naoki-san?

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:20.250
Before I realized it,
it was already the last day.

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:25.760
This can’t be true!

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:29.810
Going home without being able to spend any alone time together...

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:32.250
Hey, Irie-kun...

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:34.200
This is our last day in Hawaii, right?

00:12:35.550 --> 00:12:36.690
I guess so.

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:43.100
Well, I’d like to spend today alone together...

00:12:44.940 --> 00:12:49.240
Come to think of it, I don’t remember spending any time alone at all with you after coming here.

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:52.620
At night, you’d pass out drunk.

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:54.150
You know, Irie...

00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:57.630
That was, uh, how do you say, drinking out of jealousy...

00:12:58.860 --> 00:13:01.100
Shall we go out together then?

00:13:01.100 --> 00:13:03.710
Really? Yay!

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:05.260
Hurry up and eat.

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:14.540
Hey, maybe we should get one of those masks as a souvenir for Yuuki-kun.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:15.540
I don’t want it.

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:19.120
Did someone say something just now?

00:13:20.310 --> 00:13:23.610
Naoki-san! Kotoko-san!

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:26.500
Want to go for a cruise after this?

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:31.100
Unfortunately, we’re going out alone together today.

00:13:33.130 --> 00:13:34.600
So, see you then.

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:38.290
Let’s go, Irie-kun.

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:39.770
I can’t wait.

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:43.390
Then, let’s go too.

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:44.880
I’m not feeling so well.

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:46.260
I’m going to go sleep in the room.

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:48.050
Huh? Hey, Mari-chan!

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.680
All right! Perfect!

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:57.570
Are you ready?

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:02.820
Sorry, but it’s Horiuchi!

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:06.840
Mari is...!

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:11.410
It hurts.

00:14:11.840 --> 00:14:12.960
Any nausea?

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:14.050
I don’t think so.

00:14:14.050 --> 00:14:14.660
Fever?

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:16.000
I don’t know.

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:18.670
I thought about bringing her to see a doctor, but I worried about not being able to speak.

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:20.880
And also, Mari-san asked for you.

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:22.920
Wait a minute!

00:14:23.490 --> 00:14:24.700
Which part hurts?

00:14:25.680 --> 00:14:28.520
Irie-kun, we should call the tour guide now.

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:30.530
It’d be better to send her to the hospital.

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:33.710
It depends on what illness she has.

00:14:34.690 --> 00:14:35.900
Show me your stomach.

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:43.300
No, don’t touch her body.

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:45.890
Does it hurt when I touch you here?

00:14:45.890 --> 00:14:48.240
It’s okay.

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:57.000
No! Don’t touch other women!

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:02.450
You said that we were going to be alone together today.

00:15:02.450 --> 00:15:03.340
Yet...

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:04.880
Cut it out!

00:15:05.470 --> 00:15:08.970
You married a man who’s planning on becoming a doctor, didn’t you?

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:10.380
Have a little self-awareness!

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:14.620
How can I put up with your jealousy all the time?

00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:17.890
If you keep doing that, we won’t be able to be together forever.

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:22.980
Kotoko-san!

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:26.280
Irie-san!

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:28.230
Your wife seems okay.

00:15:28.230 --> 00:15:29.900
Her pulse is normal.

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:32.080
Perhaps it’s mild food poisoning.

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:35.060
Anyway, make her take some stomach medicine and monitor her condition.

00:15:35.060 --> 00:15:38.330
Takumi-kun, please buy some from the pharmacy downstairs.

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:42.070
Okay. Irie-san, please go after
Kotoko-san quickly.

00:15:46.350 --> 00:15:48.560
We’re finally alone.

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:52.400
Oh, weren’t you in pain?

00:15:52.400 --> 00:15:55.570
With Kotoko-san, you can’t even get in the mood to touch her, right?

00:15:55.570 --> 00:16:01.220
It’s too bad you didn’t meet me before Kotoko-san. Then...

00:16:01.220 --> 00:16:02.390
Be quiet.

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:08.080
Even if I had met you a hundred times, I’d ignore you a hundred times too.

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:12.990
You don’t even compare to Kotoko.

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:15.740
Irie-san.

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:21.170
Ah, Mari-chan, I’ve brought the medicine.

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:22.890
I met the tour guide half way.

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:24.930
Unforgivable!

00:16:26.480 --> 00:16:28.890
He made a fool of me!

00:16:29.350 --> 00:16:32.630
I’ll break those two up!

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:35.550
I’ll break them up!

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:40.280
Cut it out!

00:16:41.150 --> 00:16:42.700
What are you doing?

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:44.370
Why did you do that to me?!

00:16:44.370 --> 00:16:46.280
You’re my wife!

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:49.330
Don’t look at other men!

00:16:49.330 --> 00:16:51.460
Don’t think about other people’s unhappiness!

00:16:51.460 --> 00:16:54.870
What you should think about is being happy with me!

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:55.610
Takumi...

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:57.070
Understand?!

00:16:58.690 --> 00:16:59.590
Yes.

00:17:01.590 --> 00:17:02.710
I’ll...

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:05.350
...definitely make you happy.

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:14.590
How embarrassing.

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:18.510
No! Don’t touch other women!

00:17:19.420 --> 00:17:22.280
I only think about myself.

00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:29.520
I have to apologize to Irie-kun and to Mari-san too.

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:36.750
Where... am I?!

00:17:48.350 --> 00:17:51.830
This area looks kinda dangerous...

00:17:56.310 --> 00:18:01.590
No! I don’t want to die now after having a fight with Irie-kun!

00:18:04.090 --> 00:18:06.350
Irie-kun!

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:14.360
I still wanted to hold hands with,
date, kiss, and...

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:18.120
I still wanted to be with him more!

00:18:23.010 --> 00:18:24.540
Irie-kun!

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:26.540
I was so scared!

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:28.350
I thought that I’d never see you again!

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:30.420
I thought that this man was going to kill me!

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:37.510
What are you laughing about?!

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:40.430
You should study English more.

00:18:41.610 --> 00:18:43.220
He’s a policeman.

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:46.660
He thought that you were a lost elementary school student.

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:47.980
And he just wanted to help.

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:52.120
Anyway, apologize!

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:07.020
I’m sorry.

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:10.100
I got jealous.

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:13.990
But... But...

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:17.180
You were worried, right?

00:19:17.180 --> 00:19:18.590
Irie-kun?

00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:29.910
Hey! I purposely bought a telescopic lens just for this day!

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:41.200
So in the end, we didn’t get much time alone together, did we?

00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:46.200
But, I’m okay. I’m happy just being with you.

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:49.160
But, it’s not okay for me any more.

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:18.650
You married a man who’s planning on becoming a doctor, didn’t you?

00:20:33.490 --> 00:20:37.290
Kotoko-chan, say that again one more time?

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:39.770
I’m going to become a nurse!

00:20:40.660 --> 00:20:42.520
Why such a sudden change of heart?

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:45.660
I’m bad at whatever I do.

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:50.530
For me, becoming a nurse might be impossible.

00:20:50.530 --> 00:20:54.190
But, I...

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:58.540
I want to become a wife fit for Irie-kun!

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:02.770
But even then, you don’t have to choose such a difficult occupation.

00:21:02.770 --> 00:21:06.610
You, a nurse? Why don’t you think about the patients who have to be treated by you?!

00:21:09.980 --> 00:21:11.090
Why not?

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:17.610
You should try.

00:23:07.540 --> 00:23:08.950
I’m aiming to become a nurse!

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:10.210
I’m going to study hard!

00:23:10.210 --> 00:23:12.170
Oh, fantastic!

00:23:12.170 --> 00:23:15.510
You and Naoki are going for the same dream, right?

00:23:16.370 --> 00:23:20.740
I wanted to see the same dream as Kinnosuke too.

00:23:20.740 --> 00:23:22.260
What’s wrong, Chris?

00:23:22.840 --> 00:23:26.270
Kotoko, thank you for everything.

00:23:26.270 --> 00:23:28.150
Hey!

00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:30.880
Next time on Itazura na Kiss:

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:32.540
Chasing happiness.

00:23:32.540 --> 00:23:34.380
I’m definitely gonna be happy.
